      en: ["The current church building was officially consecrated in the year 1907.", "The iconostasis was crafted by woodcarvers from the Debar region in the early 20th century.", "The bell tower stands as a prominent separate structure next to the main nave.", "The church houses a valuable collection of over 50 historic icons.", "During the Balkan Wars, the church was used as a temporary sanctuary for locals.", "The interior frescoes underwent a major cleaning and restoration in the 1980s."],
